   "axis": "noncombat",
   "vs_three": "While Azula attacks (she need not connect): Narset's Reversal with Turnabout (unbounded mana), with Frantic Search (library-bound, about +1 mana and four cards seen a loop, at most about 26 Thermo pings: NOT a kill alone, it digs and funds Comet Storm) or with Storm-Kiln Artist (unbounded Treasures); or Snap with Dualcaster Mage (unbounded untapped lands and Dualcaster tokens). Thermo-Alchemist untaps on every cast and pings EACH opponent per cast; unbounded mana goes into Comet Storm kicked twice and copied, X lethal to all three at once. Mystical Teachings (copied in combat: two pieces) and Solve the Equation find every piece, Shred Memory transmutes for the Reversal or Snap; Narset, Parter of Veils, Gleam of Death, Brainstorm and Thirst for Knowledge dig. Never loop Frantic Search with Archmage Emeritus out (mandatory draws)."
  },
  "Copied X burn to each opponent": {
   "cards": [
    "Comet Storm",
    "Electrodominance"
   ],
   "axis": "noncombat",
   "vs_three": "Comet Storm kicked twice names all three opponents; Azula copies it, 2X to each. Turnabout copied in combat untaps every land twice, Horizon Stone and Electro keep mana from earlier steps and turns: X of 8 to 12 by turn 7. Without Azula it is cast once with banked mana. Electrodominance copied adds 2X to one or two players and casts two free spells. No combat damage needed."
  },
  "Azula, Helm and Godo in combat": {
   "cards": [
    "Fire Lord Azula",
    "Helm of the Host",
    "Godo, Bandit Warlord",
    "Ozai, the Phoenix King"
   ],
   "axis": "combat",
   "vs_three": "Helm of the Host on Azula makes a hasty Azula every combat (each spell copied twice, attacks spread across opponents); Godo puts Helm onto the battlefield and, with Helm equipped, gives unlimited combats with growing hasty Godo tokens WITHOUT Azula (late two-card line, the route that survives her removal); Ozai hits another player with 7 trample, indestructible with six floating mana. Copied Fists of Flame and removal after blocks make blocking a losing trade; Rogue's Passage makes her unblockable."
  }
